OL,3,GNEWSAPolitician who switched from
OL,4,AReform to Plaid 'lied about her
OL,5,Abeliefs', says Richard Tice
OL,6,
OL,7,FReform UK's deputy leader has accused
OL,8,Fthe party's former Senedd Member Sarah
OL,9,FCooper-Lesadd of lying to them about
OL,10,Fher political beliefs before she
OL,11,Fdefected to Plaid Cymru.
OL,13,FRichard Tice was speaking after a
OL,14,Fchaotic week for his party in which its
OL,15,FWelsh leader resigned after being
OL,16,Farrested on suspicion of assault and
OL,17,Fcontrolling or coercive behaviour.
OL,19,FHelen Jenner, the party's deputy leader
OL,20,Fin Wales, is favourite to take over
OL,21,Fnext week.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
