OL,3,GNEWSAPolitician who switched from
OL,4,AReform to Plaid 'lied about her
OL,5,Abeliefs', says Richard Tice
OL,6,
OL,7,FTice insisted the events had not
OL,8,Fdistracted the party from the issues it
OL,9,Fwas tackling, saying there were good
OL,10,Fdays and bad days in politics.
